Package: kilix-amp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: music player
 kilix-amp is a skinnable music player. This package installs the player
 and its meter library under /usr. The player reports its usage with
 --help, without opening a window.
